-*   **Noise Sampling Bug:** The reference implementation samples the noise texture using screen-space UV coordinates rather than world-space positions. This causes the noise pattern to remain fixed to the screen rather than the volume, creating a "swimming" artifact as the camera moves [S1, unofficial]. The correct approach is to sample noise using the 3D world position of the ray sample point [S1, unofficial].
